    "blocks": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The Charging Bull, also called the Wall Street Bull, is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "bronze",
            "ref": "v-bronze"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "sculpture",
            "ref": "v-sculpture"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". It stands in the "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "Financial District of Manhattan",
            "zh": "曼哈顿金融区"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in New York City. It is a "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "symbol",
            "ref": "v-symbol"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " of Wall Street. The 3,200-kg sculpture is 3.4 meters tall and 4.9 meters long. As a popular tourist attraction, it attracts thousands of people each day."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "The sculpture was created by Italian artist Arturo Di Modica. He spent $360,000 to create the sculpture following the 1987 stock "
          },
          {
            "t": "gloss",
            "v": "market crash",
            "zh": "股市崩盘"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": ". Di Modica arrived "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "penniless",
            "ref": "v-penniless"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " in the U.S. in 1970. He felt thankful to America for welcoming him. The artist created the Charging Bull to "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "inspire",
            "ref": "v-inspire"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": " people to carry on fighting through hard times. The bull is also a symbol of "
          },
          {
            "t": "vocab",
            "v": "prosperity",
            "ref": "v-prosperity"
          },
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "t": "text",
            "v": "“My point is to show people that if you want to do something during hard times, you can do it. You can do it by yourself. My point is that you must be strong,” Di Modica said."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "i1",
        "type": "imageRef",
        "image": "img1"
      }
    ]
  },
